<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z 96 NET RISES TO PLN 9 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z 96 NET RISES TO PLN 9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.66 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.06 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.65 vs   0.49 loss</p>
